       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MFCLOSE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CHKFILE ASSIGN TO "CHK" FILE STATUS IS WS-CHK-ST.
           SELECT STOPPAY ASSIGN TO "STP" FILE STATUS IS WS-STP-ST.
           SELECT CHKRPT ASSIGN TO "RPT".
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CHKFILE.
       01  CHK-REC PIC X(10).
       FD  STOPPAY.
       01  STP-REC PIC X(10).
       FD  CHKRPT.
       01  RPT-REC PIC X(10).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CHK-ST PIC XX.
       01  WS-STP-ST PIC XX.
       01  WS-RESULT PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           CLOSE CHKFILE STOPPAY CHKRPT.
           IF WS-STP-ST = "30"
               MOVE "STP-FAIL" TO WS-RESULT
           ELSE
               MOVE "OK" TO WS-RESULT
           END-IF.
